⍝ ==== s2 parser (spec §9, §18): token buffer → item tree, then tangle (§9.3)
⍝ The parser state is one array of ℤ after a sentinel. Slots 0 … 3 are
⍝ registers: position (in tokens), result (a node slot), start of the
⍝ tangled items, loop flag. Nodes follow in preorder: kind, token, size
⍝ (slots of the node and everything under it), fields, then children.
⍝   1 lit  2 call  3 anti-call  4 inverse-call  5 op         (leaves)
⍝   6 shape-call: sig          7 quote: block     8 array: ops
⍝   9 block: ops               10 select: 3 faces 11 rselect: 3 faces, block
⍝   12 face ⁼  13 face ∅       14 loop, 15 postselect, 16 prayer: block
⍝   17 handle: ok block, fail block
⍝   20 sig [nin saw]: types    21 type [np prefix tokens…]: element type (⟦…⟧)
⍝   30 fragment [name rev ordinal hasSig]: body, sig
⍝   31 particle [name]: type   32 ffi [name cname]: sig
⍝   40 fn [name rev nfr ordinals…]: sig, ops (after tangling)
⍝ Token slots point into the token buffer; −1 is the end of the file.

⍝ ---- the token buffer's index (slot 3: where it starts, slot 4: count)

⦃
  ⧖:a
  ⧗:a̵ ⟗ ᚴ ⧖:end ⧖:a
  ⧗:a̵ #3# ⧗:end ‹set› ‹ok›
  #6# ⧗:end
  ⍝ the loop carries [a j end]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,j,end
    ⧗:a̵,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:a,j,end ⧗:a̵ ⟗ ⧗:j #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n ⟗ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:rn ⧖:a ⧗:a̵ ⧗:j ⍆̵ ⧗:j #9# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧗:rn ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:a
  ⧗:a̵ ⟗ ᚴ ⧖:len ⧖:a
  ⧗:a̵ #4# ⧗:len ⧗:end ⊟ ‹set›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tindex› ⸫

⍝ ---- tokens (T is the token buffer, t a record slot)

⦃ ⧖:T,t ⧗:Ṯ,t ⧗:t ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ᚳ ⦄ ⦃ ᚳ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹tkind› ⸫

⍝ ‹is1› T t kind cp: token t has this kind and the one-code-point text cp
⦃
  ⧖:T,t,kind,cp
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› ⧗:kind ᛖ
  ⧗:t ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #7# ⊞ ᚳ △ ᛖ ⋎
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:cp ᛖ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹is1› ⸫

⍝ ‹isprefix› T t: a type prefix (a tprefix token, or one of ◌ ⟗ ⟖ ⸮ ⁖)
⦃
  ⧖:T,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› #10# ᛖ
  ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #9676# ‹is1› ⋏ ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #10199# ‹is1› ⋏ ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #10198# ‹is1› ⋏
  ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #11822# ‹is1› ⋏ ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #8278# ‹is1› ⋏
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹isprefix› ⸫

⍝ ‹peek› st T: the current token, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:st,T
  ⧗:sṯ ○ ᚳ ⧖:pos
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:Ṯ #3# ᚳ ⧗:pos ⊞ ᚳ
  ⧗:pos ⧗:Ṯ #4# ᚳ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⁼ ∅
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹peek› ⸫

⦃ ⟗ ○ ᚳ ⧖:p ○ ⧗:p △ ⊞ ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹adv› ⸫
⦃ ⟗ ○ ᚳ ⧖:p ○ ⧗:p △ ⊟ ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹back› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:st,v ⧗:st̵ △ ⧗:v ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹setres› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:st,v ⧗:st̵ #3# ⧗:v ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹setflag› ⸫

⍝ ‹emitn› st kind tok: append a node with no fields yet; the result is its slot
⦃
  ⧖:st,kind,tok
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ᚴ ⧖:r ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ △ ⧗:r ‹set› ⧗:kind ⍆̵ ⧗:tok ⍆̵ #3# ⍆̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹emitn› ⸫

⍝ ‹close› st node: the node's size covers everything appended since; the result is the node
⦃
  ⧖:st,node
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ᚴ ⧖:len ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node #2# ⊞ ⧗:len ⧗:node ⊟ ‹set› △ ⧗:node ‹set›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹close› ⸫

⍝ ‹res› st: the result register
⦃ ⟗ △ ᚳ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹res› ⸫

⍝ ---- errors

⍝ ‹perr› F T t: "path:line:col: error: " (or "path: error: " at the end of the file)
⦃
  ⧖:F,T,t
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,t ⧗:t ○ ≶ ⋔
    ⦃ ⧖:F,T,t ⧗:F̱ ⧗:Ṯ,t △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #2# ⊞ ᚳ ‹errat› ⦄ ⁼
    ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⎙̱ $: error: $ ⎙̵ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹perr› ⸫

⍝ ‹pend› t: " at end of file" when t is −1, then the newline
⦃ ⧖:t ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ at end of file$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pend› ⸫

⍝ ‹pname› T t: a function name (⌁ before an antiparticle's)
⦃
  ⧖:T,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⌁$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #7# ⊞ ᚳ ‹ptext›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pname› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptok› T t: the text of token t
⦃ ⧖:T,t ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #7# ⊞ ᚳ ‹ptext› ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹ptok› ⸫

⍝ ‹pdesc› T t: "end of file", "a string" or "kind text"
⦃
  ⧖:T,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ $end of file$ ⎙̵ ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:T,t ⧗:Ṯ,t ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ $a string$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:T,t ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› ‹pkind› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹ptok› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pdesc› ⸫

⍝ ‹fail1› st F T t: print "… error: " + a message chosen by code, at t, and fail
⍝ codes: 1 unterminated signature, 2 type prefix without a type, 3 a signature
⍝ has exactly one ⊸, 4 signature is missing ⊸, 5 the first face cannot be ⁼,
⍝ 6 types only in signatures, 7 a prayer needs a count, 8 a function name
⍝ cannot carry marks, 9 expected a fragment ordinal, 10 expected a particle
⍝ name, 11 expected the C function name as a string
⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,t,code
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,t ‹perr›
  ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $unterminated signature$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $type prefix without a type$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a signature has exactly one ⊸$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $signature is missing ⊸$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $the first face cannot be ⁼$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $types are only written in signatures, FFI bindings and particle declarations (§3)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a prayer needs a count, e.g. ⍤¹$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a function name in a definition cannot carry marks$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected a fragment ordinal$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected a particle name (Ogham letters)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected the C function name as a string$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:t ‹pend›
  ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fail1› ⸫

⍝ ‹fail2› st F T t code: "<message>, found <t>"
⍝ codes: 1 expected a type, 2 expected a face (⦃…⦄, ⁼ or ∅), 3 expected a
⍝ function name (Runic letters), 4 a fragment ordinal is a balanced-ternary
⍝ integer, 5 expected a particle name (Ogham letters), 6 expected the C
⍝ function name as a string, 7 expected an item (…)
⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,t,code
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,t ‹perr›
  ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected a type$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected a face (⦃…⦄, ⁼ or ∅)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected a function name (Runic letters)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a fragment ordinal is a balanced-ternary integer$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected a particle name (Ogham letters)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected the C function name as a string$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected an item (⦃ function, ⇋ reversible function, ⚛ particle or ⎔ binding)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $, found $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pdesc›
  ⧗:t ‹pend›
  ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fail2› ⸫

⍝ ‹failx› st F T t cp code: 1 "expected <cp>, found <t>", 2 "unclosed <cp>",
⍝ 3 "unexpected <t's text>", 4 "unexpected <t's text> inside a block",
⍝ 5 "<cp> needs a superscript index, e.g. <cp>⁰"
⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,t,cp,code
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,t ‹perr›
  ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $expected $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $unclosed $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #3# ᛖ ⧗:code #4# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ $unexpected $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:cp ⧗:code △ #2# ᛦ ⧗:code #5# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ᚢ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ⧗:code #3# #4# ᛦ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $, found $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pdesc› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:code #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ inside a block$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:cp ⧗:code #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ needs a superscript index, e.g. $ ⎙̵ ᚢ $⁰$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:t ‹pend›
  ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹failx› ⸫

⍝ ‹expect› st T F kind cp: consume a token of this kind and text; the result is the token
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,kind,cp
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ ‹peek› ⧖:t ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,t,cp
  ⧗:Ṯ,t,kind,cp ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:st,F,T,t,cp ⧗:st̵ ‹adv› ⧗:t ‹setres› ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹failx› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹expect› ⸫

⍝ ---- types and signatures (§3)

⍝ ‹tybase› st T F node t: the part after the prefixes
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› #9# ᛖ ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› #2# ᛖ ⋏
  ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,node,t ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node △ ⊞ ⧗:t ‹set› ‹adv› △ ‹setflag› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
      ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,t ⧗:Ṯ,t #11# #10214# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ‹tyarray› ⦄
        ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
          ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,t ⧗:Ṯ,t #11# #10216# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ‹tyquote› ⦄
            ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,node,t ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,t ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ‹fail1› ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹fail2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tybase› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
  ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node △ ⊞ ⧗:t ‹set› ‹adv› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ ‹type› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ #11# #10215# ‹expect› △ ‹setflag›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tyarray› ⸫

⍝ ‹tyquote› st T F node t: a quotation type (§9.5): base ⟨, and the signature as its child
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
  ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node △ ⊞ ⧗:t ‹set› ‹ok› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ ‹sig› △ ‹setflag›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tyquote› ⸫

⍝ ‹typfx› st T F node t: prefix t; a bare ◌ before ⊸ or ⟩ is a whole type
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
  ⧗:st̵ ⧗:t ⍆̵ ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:node #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:np ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node #3# ⊞ ⧗:np △ ⊞ ‹set› ‹adv› ‹ok› ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ ‹peek› ⧖:u ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,u #8# #8888# ‹is1› ⧗:Ṯ,u #11# #10217# ‹is1› ⋏
  ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:st,F,T,t ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,t ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #9676# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ △ ‹setflag› ⦄ ⦃ #2# ‹fail1› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
    ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ○ ‹setflag› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹typfx› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ ‹peek› ⧖:t ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹isprefix› ⋔ ⦃ ‹typfx› ⦄ ⦃ ‹tybase› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹type1› ⸫

⍝ ‹type› st T F: a type node [21 base size np prefixes…] (base −1: a bare ◌)
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F
  ⧗:st̵ #21# #-1# ‹emitn› ‹ok› ○ ⍆̵ ‹res› ⧖:node ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,F,node
    ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node ‹type1› ‹ok› ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:done ⧖:st
    ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node ⧗:done ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⧗:node ‹close›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹type› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ ‹peek› ⧖:t ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t #11# #10217# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ‹adv› △ ‹setflag› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
      ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,t ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #8888# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ‹sigarrow› ⦄
        ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
          ⍝ a type: an input until ⊸ is seen
          ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:node #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:saw ⟗ ⧗:node #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:nin ⧖:st
          ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node #3# ⊞ ⧗:nin ⧗:saw ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ‹set› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ ‹type› ○ ‹setflag› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sig1› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node,t
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:node #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:saw ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,t,node
  ⧗:saw △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ‹fail1› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:st,F,T,t,node ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node #4# ⊞ △ ‹set› ‹adv› ○ ‹setflag› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sigarrow› ⸫

⍝ ‹sig› st T F: ⟨ inputs ⊸ outputs ⟩ as [20 ⟨ size nin saw] and the types
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱ #11# #10216# ‹expect› ‹ok› ‹res› ⧖:open ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ #20# ⧗:open ‹emitn› ‹ok› ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ‹res› ⧖:node ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node
  ⥀ ⦃
