  ⧗:s #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,s,node ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,s #11# ‹fail1› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,s,node ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,s,node ⧗:Ṯ,s ‹tkind› #12# ᛖ
      ⋔ ⦃ ‹ffi2› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,s,node ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,s #6# ‹fail2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ffi› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ ‹peek› ⧖:t ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #9883# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹particle› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,t ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,t ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #9108# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ffi› ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,t ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,t ⧗:Ṯ,t #8# #8651# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:T2,F2 ‹adv› ⧗:T2̱,F2̱ △ ‹function› ⦄
        ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,t ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,t ⧗:Ṯ,t #11# #10627# ‹is1› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ‹function› ⦄
          ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,t ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,t #7# ‹fail2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹item› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,F
    ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ ‹peek› ⧖:t ⧖:st
    ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱ ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱ ‹item› ‹ok› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹items› ⸫

⍝ ---- tangle (§9.3): fragments → functions

⦃ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨ŧ ŧ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹teq› ⸫

⍝ ‹rangeeq› T i j n: slots i … i+n−1 equal j … j+n−1 (n ≥ 1)
⦃
  ⧖:T,i,j,n
  ⧗:Ṯ,i,j ⧗:i ⧗:n ⊞ ⦶
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:T,i,j,end,acc
    ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end
    ⧗:acc ⧗:Ṯ,i ᚳ ⧗:Ṯ,j ᚳ ᛖ ⋎
    ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:T,i,j,end,acc ⧗:acc
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹rangeeq› ⸫

⍝ ‹texteq› T a b: tokens a and b have the same text
⦃
  ⧖:T,a,b
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:a #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:b #7# ⊞ ᚳ ᛖ
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:a #8# ⊞ ⧗:b #8# ⊞ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:a #7# ⊞ ᚳ ‹rangeeq› ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹texteq› ⸫

⍝ ‹nameeq› T a b: the same name (an antiparticle's carries its ⌁)
⦃
  ⧖:T,a,b
  ⧗:Ṯ,a ‹tkind› #3# ᛖ ⧗:Ṯ,b ‹tkind› #3# ᛖ ‹teq› ⧗:Ṯ,a,b ‹texteq› ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹nameeq› ⸫

⍝ ‹pred› T kj nj ni mode: item j (kind kj, name nj) matches name ni:
⍝ 1 a non-fragment of that name, 2 anything of that name, 3 a fragment of
⍝ that name, 4 the antiparticle fragment of particle ni
⦃
  ⧖:T,kj,nj,ni,mode
  ⧗:Ṯ,nj,ni ‹nameeq› ⧖:eq
  ⧗:kj #30# ᛖ ⧖:isfr
  ⊕
  ⧗:mode △ ᛖ ⧗:eq ⋎ ⧗:isfr ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:mode #2# ᛖ ⧗:eq ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:mode #3# ᛖ ⧗:eq ⋎ ⧗:isfr ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:mode #4# ᛖ ⧗:isfr ⋎ ⧗:Ṯ,nj ‹tkind› #3# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:Ṯ,nj,ni ‹texteq› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹pred› ⸫

⍝ ‹scan› st T to ni mode: some item before slot to matches (see ‹pred›)
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,to,ni,mode
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,to,ni,mode #6# ⊕
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,to,ni,mode,j,acc
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,to,ni,mode,j,acc ⧗:j ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,to,ni,mode,j,acc
        ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,to,ni,mode ⧗:j ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⊞
        ⧗:acc ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,j ᚳ ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:ni,mode ‹pred› ⋏
        ⧗:j ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⊞ ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:st,T,to,ni,mode,j,acc ⧗:acc
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹scan› ⸫

⍝ ‹dupi› st T F i: item i must not reuse an earlier item's name
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,i
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:i ᚳ ⧖:ki ⟗ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:ni ⟗ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:itok ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ,i,ni ⧗:ki #30# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ #2# ⦄ ⁼ ‹scan› ⧖:hit ⧖:st
  ⧗:ni ⧗:itok ⧗:ki #30# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:at
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,at,ni
  ⧗:hit ⋔ ⦃ ‹duperr› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹dupi› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,at,ni
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,at ‹perr› $name defined twice: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,ni ‹pname› $\n$ ⎙̵ ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹duperr› ⸫

⍝ ‹key› st T f: fragment f's ordinal (○ when it has none)
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,f
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:f #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:o
  ⧗:Ṯ,o ⧗:o #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ ⦄ ⦃ #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹key› ⸫

⍝ ‹grpmsg› st F T f g: f repeats g's ordinal
⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,f,g
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:f #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:nt ⟗ ⧗:f #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:of ⟗ ⧗:g #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:og ⧖:st
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,nt ‹perr›
  ⧗:Ṯ,nt ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ⧗:og #-1# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔
    ⦃ $function $ ⎙̵ ‹pname› $ is defined twice$ ⎙̵ ⦄
    ⦃ $duplicate fragment ordinal for $ ⎙̵ ‹pname› ⦄ ⁼
  $\n$ ⎙̵ ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹grpmsg› ⸫

⍝ ‹samekey› st T i f ni: the first fragment of name ni in i … f−1 with f's ordinal, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,f,ni
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,f ‹key› ⧖:kf
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,f,ni,kf ⧗:i #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,f,ni,kf,j,found
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,f,ni,kf,j,found ⧗:j ⧗:f ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,f,ni,kf,j,found
        ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,f,ni,kf ⧗:j ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⊞
        ⧗:found ⧗:j
        ⧗:found #-1# ᛖ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,j ᚳ ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:ni #3# ‹pred› ⋎ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,j ‹key› ⧗:kf ᛖ ⋎
        ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:j ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⊞ ⧗:f ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:st,T,f,ni,kf,j,found ⧗:found
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹samekey› ⸫

⍝ ‹grpdup1› st T F i f ni: fragment f (of the group starting at i) must not repeat an ordinal
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,i,f,ni
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ,i,f,ni ‹samekey› ⧖:g ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,f,g ⧗:g #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ ‹grpmsg› ‹ok› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹grpdup1› ⸫

⍝ ‹grpdup› st T F i ni: no two fragments of the group share an ordinal
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,i,ni
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ #2# ᚳ ⧖:end ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,i,end
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,F,i,ni,f,end
    ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,f,end ⧗:f ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,i,ni,f,end
        ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:f ᚳ ⧖:kf ⟗ ⧗:f #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:nf ⟗ ⧗:f #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:sz ⧖:st
        ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,f,ni
        ⧗:kf #30# ᛖ ⧗:Ṯ,nf,ni ‹nameeq› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹grpdup1› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:Ṯ,F̱,i,ni ⧗:f ⧗:sz ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹grpdup› ⸫

⍝ ‹nextfrag› st T i ni prev: the fragment of name ni (from i on) with the
⍝ smallest ordinal above prev, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ni,prev
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:sṯ #2# ᚳ ⧖:end ⌁̱
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,ni,prev,end ⧗:i #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,ni,prev,end,j,best
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,ni,prev,end,j,best ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,ni,prev,end,j,best
        ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,ni,prev,end ⧗:j ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⊞
        ⧗:best ⧗:j
        ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,j ᚳ ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:ni #3# ‹pred›
        ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,j ‹key› ⧗:prev ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎
        ⧗:best #-1# ᛖ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,j ‹key› ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,best ‹key› ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋏ ⋎
        ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:j ⧗:sṯ ⧗:j #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⊞ ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:st,T,ni,prev,end,j,best ⧗:best
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹nextfrag› ⸫

⍝ ‹copyr› st from n: append slots from … from+n−1 of st to st
⦃
  ⧖:st,from,n
  ⧗:st̵,from ⧗:from ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,j,end
    ⧗:st̵,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,j,end ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:j ᚳ ⍆̵ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹copyr› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:st,node,ftok,fname ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node △ ⊞ ⧗:ftok ‹set› ⧗:node #3# ⊞ ⧗:fname ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fnname› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,fname
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,fname ‹perr› $only one fragment of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,fname ‹pname› $ may carry the signature\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sigmany› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,fname,f,sigf
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,fname,f
  ⧗:sigf #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:st,F,T,fname,f ⧗:st̵ #4# ⧗:f ‹set› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹sigmany› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sigone› ⸫

⍝ ‹sweep1› st T F node f: count fragment f into fn node; one signature only
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node,f
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:node #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:nfr ⟗ ⧗:node #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:rev ⟗ ⧗:f #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:frev
    ⟗ ⧗:f #6# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:has ⟗ #4# ᚳ ⧖:sigf ⟗ ⧗:f △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:ftok ⟗ ⧗:f #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:fname ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⧗:node #5# ⊞ ⧗:nfr △ ⊞ ‹set› ⧗:node #4# ⊞ ⧗:rev ⧗:frev ⋓ ‹set› ‹ok› ⧖:st
  ⍝ the first fragment names the function
  ⧗:st̵,node,ftok,fname ⧗:nfr ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹fnname› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,fname,f,sigf ⧗:has △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹sigone› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sweep1› ⸫

⍝ ‹sweepdo› st T F node f mode: 1 count and check, 2 append the ordinal, 3 append the body's ops
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,node,f,mode
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,f ⧗:mode △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹sweep1› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⟗ ⧗:f #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:f #9# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:bsz ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,o,f,bsz,mode
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⍆̵ ⦄
    ⦃ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:b ⧖:f2 ⌁ ⧗:f2 #10# ⊞ ⧗:b #3# ⊟ ‹copyr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sweepdo› ⸫

⍝ ‹sweep› st T F i ni node mode: the fragments of name ni in ordinal order
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,i,ni,node,mode
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,node,mode #-100000000#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,F,i,ni,node,mode,prev
    ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ,i,ni,prev ‹nextfrag› ⧖:f ⧖:st
    ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,node,mode,prev,f
    ⧗:f #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,i,ni,node,mode,prev,f
        ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,node,f,mode ‹sweepdo› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ,f ‹key› ⧖:k ⧖:st
        ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,node,mode,k ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sweep› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,fname,nfr
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,fname ‹perr›
  ⧗:Ṯ,fname ⧗:nfr △ ᛖ ⋔
    ⦃ $function $ ⎙̵ ‹pname› $ has no signature ⟨… ⊸ …⟩$ ⎙̵ ⦄
    ⦃ $no fragment of $ ⎙̵ ‹pname› $ carries a signature$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
  $\n$ ⎙̵ ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹nosig› ⸫

⍝ ‹group› st T F i: the function whose first fragment is item i
⍝ [40 ⦃ size name rev nfr ordinals…]: sig, ops
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,i
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:ni ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,ni ‹grpdup› ‹ok›
  #40# #-1# ‹emitn› ‹ok› #-1# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ‹res› ⧖:node ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ #4# #-1# ‹set› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,node △ ‹sweep› ‹ok›
  ⟗ #4# ᚳ ⧖:sigf ⟗ ⧗:node #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:nfr ⟗ ⧗:node #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:fname ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,fname,nfr ⧗:sigf #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹nosig› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⍝ the ordinals, the signature, then the bodies
  ⧗:Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,node #2# ‹sweep› ‹ok›
  ⟗ ⧗:sigf #9# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:bsz ⧖:st
  ⧗:sigf #7# ⊞ ⧗:bsz ⊞ ⧖:sigslot
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:sigslot #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:ssz ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⧗:sigslot ⧗:ssz ‹copyr›
  ⧗:Ṯ,F̱,i,ni,node #3# ‹sweep› ⧗:node ‹close›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹group› ⸫

⍝ ‹tangle1› st T F i: copy a particle or binding; tangle a function at its first fragment
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,i
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:i ᚳ ⧖:k ⟗ ⧗:i #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:sz ⟗ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:ni ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ,i,ni #3# ‹scan› ⧖:seen ⧖:st
  #2# ⧗:seen ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:k #30# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:a
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,sz ⧗:a
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄
    ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,i,sz ⧗:st̵,i,sz ‹copyr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹group› ‹ok› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tangle1› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,F,T,itok,ni
  ⧗:F̱,Ṯ,itok ‹perr› $particle $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,ni ‹ptok› $ has no antiparticle ⌁$ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,ni ‹ptok› $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:st̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹noanti› ⸫

⍝ ‹anti1› st T F i: a particle needs an antiparticle ⌁T (§8.6)
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,i
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:i ᚳ ⧖:k ⟗ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:ni ⟗ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:itok ⟗ #2# ᚳ ⧖:pe ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ,pe,ni #4# ‹scan› ⧖:has ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,F̱,Ṯ,itok,ni ⧗:k #31# ᛖ ⧗:has ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹noanti› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹anti1› ⸫

⍝ ‹tpass› st T F from end pass: run pass 1 (‹dupi›), 2 (‹tangle1›) or 3 (‹anti1›) on the items from … end−1
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,F,from,end,pass
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,from,end,pass
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,F,i,end,pass
    ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,end,pass ⧗:i ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,F,i,end,pass
        ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:i #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:sz ⧖:st
        ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,i,pass ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹dupi› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tangle1› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ‹anti1› ‹ok› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ ⧗:i ⧗:sz ⊞ ⧗:end,pass ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tpass› ⸫

⍝ ‹parse› T F: the tangled item tree of a token buffer
⦃
  ⧖:T,F
  ⟦ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ⟧ ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ ‹items› ‹ok› ⟗ ᚴ ⧖:e ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵ #2# ⧗:e ‹set› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ #6# ⧗:e △ ‹tpass› ⧗:Ṯ,F̱ #6# ⧗:e #2# ‹tpass› ‹ok›
  ⟗ ᚴ ⧖:e2 ⧖:st
  ⧗:st̵,Ṯ,F̱,e,e2 #3# ‹tpass›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹parse› ⸫

⍝ ---- the item tree, printed as trithc --ast prints it

⦃ ⧖:n ⧗:n ⧗:n ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ $  $ ⎙̵ △ ⊟ ‹pind› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pind› ⸫

⍝ ‹pmk› T t: " [mark,mark]"
⦃
  ⧖:T,t
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:mask
  ⧗:mask ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ [$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:mask △ ⦶
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:mask,bit,first
    ⧗:mask ⧗:bit ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧖:on
    ⧗:on ⧗:first ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ $,$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:bit ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ᛗᚾ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:mask ⧗:bit △ ≪ ⧗:first ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:bit #128# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
  ⧗:mask ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $]$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pmk› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptoks› st T from n: the texts of tokens st[from] … st[from+n−1]
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,from,n
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,from ⧗:from ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,j,end
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,j,end ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,j ᚳ ‹ptok› ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹ptoks› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptbase› st T c np base: the base of a type node
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,c,np,base
  ⧗:Ṯ,base ‹tkind› ⧖:k
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:base #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:base #6# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:copen
  ⧗:Ṯ,base ⧗:k #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:base #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:copen ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
  ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptext› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:base #9# ⊞ ⧗:copen ⊞ ⧗:base #7# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞
  ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ $⁽$ ⎙̵ ‹pcharge› $⁾$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:c #4# ⊞ ⧗:np ⊞
  ⍝ 0: no child, 1: an array's element type, 2: a quotation type's signature
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:base #8# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:b0
  ○ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⧗:b0 #10216# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟦$ ⎙̵ ‹ptyp› ⌁ $⟧$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹psig› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹ptbase› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptyp› st T c: a type node, giving the slot after it
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,c
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:c △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:base
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:c #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:sz
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:c #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:np
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:c #4# ⊞ ⧗:np ‹ptoks›
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c,np,base ⧗:base #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ ‹ptbase› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:c ⧗:sz ⊞
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ptyp› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptypes› st T from count end lead: up to count types before slot end,
⍝ separated by spaces (and one before the first if lead); the slot after them
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,from,count,end,lead
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,from,count,end,lead
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,c,count,end,lead
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c,count,end,lead
    ⧗:count ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:c ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:st,T,c,count,end,lead
        ⧗:lead ⋔ ⦃ $ $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
        ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c ‹ptyp› ⧗:count △ ⊟ ⧗:end ⦶ ⊕ ⦄
      ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:st,T,c,count,end,lead ⧗:c
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ptypes› ⸫

⍝ ‹psig› st T s: ⟨ins ⊸ outs⟩
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,s
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:s #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:nin
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:s #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:s ⊞ ⧖:end
  $⟨$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:s #5# ⊞ ⧗:nin ⧗:end ⊕ ‹ptypes› ⧖:c
  ⧗:nin ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ $ $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅
  $⊸$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c #1000000# ⧗:end ⦶ ‹ptypes› ⌁
  $⟩$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹psig› ⸫

⍝ ‹pval› T t: " = value" of a numeral
⦃
  ⧖:T,t
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› ⧖:k
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:v1
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #6# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:v2
  ⧗:k #5# ᛖ ⧗:k #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ $ = $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:k,v1,v2 ‹pvalue2›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pval› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:kind,v1,v2
  ⧗:v1 ⧗:kind #5# ᛖ ⧗:kind #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ᛁ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:v2 ⧗:kind #6# ᛖ ⧗:v2 △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ $/$ ⎙̵ ᛁ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pvalue2› ⸫

⍝ ‹dops› st T from to ind: the ops from … to−1
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,from,to,ind
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,from,to,ind
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,c,to,ind
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c,to,ind ⧗:c ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:st,T,c,to,ind ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c,ind ‹dop› ⧗:to,ind ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dops› ⸫

⍝ ‹dblock› st T b ind: the ops of block b, giving the slot after it
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,b,ind
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:b #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:b ⊞ ⧖:end
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:b #3# ⊞ ⧗:end,ind ‹dops›
  ⧗:end
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹dblock› ⸫

⍝ ‹dface› st T c ind: one face, giving the slot after it
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,c,ind
  ⧗:sṯ,c ᚳ ⧖:k
  ⧗:ind ‹pind›
  ⧗:k #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $face ⁼\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:k #13# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $face ∅\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c ⧗:ind △ ⊞
  ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $face\n$ ⎙̵ ‹dblock› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:c ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⧗:c #3# ⊞ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹dface› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,c,ind
  ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹pind› $assert\n$ ⎙̵ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c ⧗:ind #2# ⊞ ‹dblock› ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dassert› ⸫

⍝ op printers: st T i ind t sz (k)
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz
  $lit $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› ‹pkind› $ $ ⎙̵
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹tkind› #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pquoted› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ptext› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pval› ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pmk› $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dlit› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz,k
  ⧗:k #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $call $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:k #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $anti-call $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:k #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $inverse-call $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pname› ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pmk› $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dcall› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz
  $op $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹ptok› ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #4# ⊞ ᚳ ‹pidx› ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pmk› $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dopx› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz
  $shape-call $ ⎙̵ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ‹psig› $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dshape› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz
  $quote\n$ ⎙̵ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹dblock› ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dquote› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz
  $array\n$ ⎙̵ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ⧗:i ⧗:sz ⊞ ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹dops›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹darray› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz,k
  ⧗:k #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $select$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $rselect$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pmk› $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹dface› ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹dface› ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹dface› ⧖:c
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c,ind ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹dassert› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dsel› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz,k
  ⧗:k #14# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $loop$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:k #15# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $postselect$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:k #16# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $prayer$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:t #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n
  ⧗:n #-9# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ n=$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:n ⧗:n #-9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ᛁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pmk› $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹dblock› ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dwrap› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind,t,sz
  $handle$ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,t ‹pmk› $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹pind› $ok\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ⧗:ind #2# ⊞ ‹dblock› ⧖:c
  ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹pind› $fail\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,c ⧗:ind #2# ⊞ ‹dblock› ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dhandle› ⸫

⍝ ‹dop› st T i ind: one op, giving the slot after it
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,ind
  ⧗:sṯ,i ᚳ ⧖:k
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:t
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:sz
  ⧗:ind ‹pind›
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,i,ind,t,sz,k
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹dlit› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# #4# ᛦ ⋔ ⦃ ‹dcall› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹dopx› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹dshape› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹dquote› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹darray› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #10# #11# ᛦ ⋔ ⦃ ‹dsel› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #17# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹dhandle› ⦄ ⦃ ‹dwrap› ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:i ⧗:sz ⊞
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹dop› ⸫

⍝ ‹pfrags› st T i nfr: " fragments=…" unless the function is one unnumbered (or ○) fragment
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,nfr
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #6# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:o
  ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:o #7# ⊞ ᚳ △ ᛖ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:o #8# ⊞ ᚳ #9675# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:o #-1# ᛖ ⋏ ⧖:plain
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,i,nfr
  ⧗:nfr △ ᛖ ⧗:plain ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ $ fragments=$ ⎙̵ ‹pords› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pfrags› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,nfr
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #6# ⊞ ⧗:i #6# ⊞ ⧗:i #6# ⊞ ⧗:nfr ⊞
  ⍝ the loop carries [st T j first end]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,j,first,end
    ⧗:j ⧗:first ≶ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ $,$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅
    ⧗:sṯ,j ᚳ ⧖:o
    ⧗:Ṯ,o ⧗:o #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ $○$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹ptok› ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:first,end
    ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pords› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,name
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:nfr
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:rev
  ⧗:i #6# ⊞ ⧗:nfr ⊞ ⧖:s
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:s #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:s ⊞ ⧖:body
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:i ⊞ ⧖:end
  $fn $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,name ‹pname› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,s ‹psig›
  ⧗:rev ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ reversible$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,i,nfr ‹pfrags› $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,body,end △ ‹dops›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dfn› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,name
  $particle $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,name ‹ptok› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #4# ⊞ ‹ptyp› ⌁ $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dpart› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i,name
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:cn
  $ffi $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ,name ‹pname› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:cn #8# ⊞ ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:cn #7# ⊞ ᚳ ‹pquoted› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:i #5# ⊞ ‹psig› $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹dffi› ⸫

⍝ ‹ditem› st T i: one tangled item, giving the slot after it
⦃
  ⧖:st,T,i
  ⧗:sṯ,i ᚳ ⧖:k
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:sz
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:i #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:name
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,i,name,k
  ⧗:k #40# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹dfn› ⦄ ⦃ #31# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹dpart› ⦄ ⦃ ‹dffi› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:i ⧗:sz ⊞
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ditem› ⸫

⍝ ‹adump› st T: every tangled item
⦃
  ⧖:st,T
  ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:sṯ #2# ᚳ ⧗:sṯ ᚴ
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:st,T,i,end
    ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,i,end ⧗:i ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:st,T,i,end ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ ⧗:sṯ,Ṯ,i ‹ditem› ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹adump› ⸫
